WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:05.920
Bold lines are definitely in—and that clearly
shows in the calories and serving size.

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.340
Such a fresh look.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:11.720
New information is listed, like potassium,
Added Sugars—that’s something we just

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.650
haven’t seen from them before.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:16.600
This latest piece from the House of FDA says
so much.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:17.960
It’s speaking to me.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:22.110
I imagine this will be the “it” wear for
many seasons, and years, to come.

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:24.030
See what’s new…and what’s been updated.

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:27.670
The new Nutrition Facts label…see what’s
in it for you at FDA.gov/NewNutritionFactsLabel.

